id: telepathic-teamwork
name: Telepathic Teamwork
talentCategory: racial
race: namekian
prerequisites: Namekian, Telepathic Warning, 2+ Teamwork Talents
description: >
  Your inherent telepathy makes coordinating with others both silent and deadly.
text: >
  Telepathic Teamwork: Your inherent telepathy makes coordinating with others both silent and deadly.
  –Prerequisites: Namekian, Telepathic Warning, 2+ Teamwork Talents
  (1)-[Passive]: If you are in the Melee Range of a Character you are telepathically communicating with (see — Telepathy Unique Ability), increase both of your Wound Rolls by 1(T). This effect cannot stack.
  (2)-[Triggered, 2/Round]: If an Ally makes an Attacking Maneuver, you may increase the Strike Roll of that Attacking Maneuver by 1(T). If a target of that Attacking Maneuver is Studied, increase the Wound Roll of that Attacking Maneuver by 1(T) as well.

---

[passive]
# (1) In the Melee Range of one you are linked with by Telepathy: your Wound Rolls and theirs 1(T) - once, however many (chat.mjs
# telepathicWoundParts).
allow telepathic.teamworkWound;
# (2) An Ally's attack: a button on its card till its Strike is rolled, twice a Round - 1(T) on its Strike; a target Studied, 1(T) on
# its Wound as well (chat.mjs telepathicTeamworkButtons).
allow telepathic.teamworkStrike;
